      "title": "wslua: Fix segfault when registering a field / ei twice",
      "message": "wslua: Fix segfault when registering a field / ei twice\n\nWe need to call Proto_commit as a protected function so that\nerrors don't call wslua_panic and abort, but instead are handled\ngracefully.\n\nFix #19194\n",
